A restaurant kitchen

A `Waiter` sends tickets to the `Kitchen display`, with the label `ticket`. The
`Grill cook` and the `Salad cook` read the `Kitchen display`, with the label
`read`. Both hand plates to the `Pass`, with the label `plate`. The `Waiter`
collects from the `Pass`, with the label `collect`.
---
Waiter -> Kitchen display: ticket
Grill cook, Salad cook -> Kitchen display: read
Grill cook, Salad cook -> Pass: plate
Waiter -> Pass: collect
